Pin Kotlin by setting the Kotlin plugin version in your Gradle build configuration.

**`build.gradle.kts` (recommended):**
```kotlin
plugins {
    kotlin("jvm") version "2.0.21"
}
```

For Android projects:

```kotlin
plugins {
    id("com.android.application") version "8.5.2"
    id("org.jetbrains.kotlin.android") version "2.0.21"
}
```

You can also centralize the version in `settings.gradle.kts`:

```kotlin
pluginManagement {
    plugins {
        kotlin("jvm") version "2.0.21"
    }
}
```

For Kotlin Multiplatform, use the same version on `org.jetbrains.kotlin.multiplatform`. Avoid using dynamic versions such as `2.+`; pin exact versions for reproducible builds.
